@startuml TransactionIngestion

actor User
participant Browser
participant "React App" as React
participant "API Client" as Api
participant "FastAPI Router\n(api/ingestion.py)" as Router
participant Parser
participant Cleaner
participant Validator
participant "Ingestion Service" as Service
database PostgreSQL

User -> Browser : Upload CSV
Browser -> React : File
React -> Api : POST /transactions/import
Api -> Router : Request

Router -> Parser : parse(csv)
Parser -> Cleaner : clean(data)
Cleaner -> Validator : validate(data)

Validator -> Service : process(transactions)
Service -> PostgreSQL : insert transactions

PostgreSQL --> Service
Service --> Router
Router --> Api
Api --> React
React --> Browser

@enduml